  "title": "PURSUE LRP/ERN Flanker",
  "description": "EEG dataset from the PURSUE project containing a flanker task designed to elicit the lateralized readiness potential (LRP) and error-related negativity (ERN). Data were collected in 2017 and 2018 from participants at three primarily undergraduate institutions in Southern California, Massachusetts, and Virginia. The task follows the ERP CORE paradigm.",
  "methods_description": "Participants completed a flanker task based on the ERP CORE design (Kappenman et al., 2021) while EEG was recorded at three primarily undergraduate academic institutions. Task details are provided in the supplementary materials.",
